00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:26.560 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Tout ce que recherchait

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:27.794 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mylène Senécal pour

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:29.029 size:53% position:73% line:53%
